        "jcr:created": "Wed Jun 10 2026 16:47:08 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Does your facility use adjunct technology to help reduce retained surgical sponges and assess real-time blood loss?</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/surgical-technologies/products/surgicount-safety-sponge-system.html\">Discover how SurgiCount+ and Triton can integrate into your workflow.</a></span></p>\n",
